    "detailed_description": "In VariDungeon, you are a hero exploring a dungeon. It may sound classic, but each run is different because its structure changes every time you start again ! Power-ups, enemies, bosses, traps, ... You need to adapt to all these elements in order to defeat the final boss and save the King !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures :<br />\r\n- Gorgeous pixel-art graphics in the style of Game Boy<br />\r\n- 6 playable classes<br />\r\n- 65 enemies and traps that get stronger as you so<br />\r\n- 19 power-ups to combine in order to win each fight<br />\r\n- 17 bosses trying to kill you<br />\r\n- more than 250 rooms<br />\r\n- More environments, enemies, power-ups, playable characters and bosses to come in themed updates !",
    "about_the_game": "In VariDungeon, you are a hero exploring a dungeon. It may sound classic, but each run is different because its structure changes every time you start again ! Power-ups, enemies, bosses, traps, ... You need to adapt to all these elements in order to defeat the final boss and save the King !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures :<br />\r\n- Gorgeous pixel-art graphics in the style of Game Boy<br />\r\n- 6 playable classes<br />\r\n- 65 enemies and traps that get stronger as you so<br />\r\n- 19 power-ups to combine in order to win each fight<br />\r\n- 17 bosses trying to kill you<br />\r\n- more than 250 rooms<br />\r\n- More environments, enemies, power-ups, playable characters and bosses to come in themed updates !",
    "short_description": "Explore infinite random dungeons with amazing retro pixel art graphics ! Find the best build by testing all the power-ups available, and don't forget to look for all the secrets !",
